{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "d08440a45238432e66a54975885273214562010fca584d8d7b30fc4bfd28167f", "ja": "始まりは、素敵な香りと共に……♪", "zh": "在美妙香气的陪伴下揭开序幕……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42b76ab8150922468fb964715ed4a64a7ea2680a43deada1acef1f182269a717", "ja": "プロデューサーが『三姉妹カフェ』の\n初ミーティングに向かうと、控え室の中から\nいい香りがしてくる。そこでは歌織が共演\nするメンバー達に、役作りのために習った\nコーヒーを振る舞っていた。", "zh": "制作人准备去参加《三姊妹咖啡厅》的\n首次会议，在经过准备室时闻到诱人香气。\n原来是歌织为融入角色而学习咖啡冲泡法，\n而她正在那里招待一起拍戏的成员们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "339983ca367ec9642d2c788422c0e5fcf8feb6a248ff226c1774b6d77b4572bb", "ja": "（うん？　控え室から、香ばしくて\nいい香りがするな。この匂いは……）", "zh": "（嗯？准备室传来好诱人的香气。\n这个味道是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d3d250652d6dec300ad117ab55b0deaca085fd49e7429eaa5dd09877053a068", "ja": "コーヒーありがとうございます、歌織さん。\nいただきます。", "zh": "谢谢你泡的咖啡，歌织姊。\n我要喝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "13751e9889162976c4f170f97366295499e5a2550486bcac54ecaedeafa8fc07", "ja": "みんな、熱いから気をつけてね。\n莉緒ちゃんは、ブラックでよかったわよね？", "zh": "大家要小心烫喔。\n莉绪，你要黑咖啡对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "fe397d492b4591a84e67af1b2550e07f48751a4328f3682069c187d7305450fe", "ja": "ええ、ありがと。\n……はぁ、おいしい♪", "zh": "嗯，谢谢。\n……呼，真好喝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "465df685c40a562a71f1e3f17aeab85d94214eb05d4c266d24e39cea330e1d56", "ja": "大人って不思議よね～。子どもの頃は苦くて嫌いだった\nブラックが、平気で飲めるようになっちゃうんだから。", "zh": "成人真是不可思议呢～小时候觉得又苦又讨厌的黑咖啡，\n现在已经能轻松喝下肚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "87adb3fe298c2a4a2303dcb8ba7e8db0f862609bb4311e742d84036f80ced55e", "ja": "フフ、そうね。苦いものを美味しいと感じるように\nなるなんて……本当に、どうしてなのかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，对呀，长大后居然会觉得苦涩的东西很美味……\n究竟是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1006_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9acb3d2f2b0bfa57c663d4913889d5271ee119945d7d5bc9c1bff5604c613931", "ja": "おはよう。\nみんな、集まってるみたいだな！", "zh": "早安。\n看来大家都在这呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "b60b0c7bb7065f91f9f9678ed5661a14b0afa77037807098d80be1fffcfb9da4", "ja": "あ……、{$P$}さん……。\nおはよう……ございます……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……\n早……安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "2a0c70236834f98ee4b285fae4033fa744d2b93a03e65fe0d0d5170e6e0dfb78", "ja": "ミーティングの前に、歌織さんに\nコーヒーを淹れてもらっていたんですよ～。", "zh": "歌织姊在开会前泡咖啡给大家喝呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "6677bee407a23cc7cd75afdc965de90afd246f6dbcc9e20289d6b236b90c9e94", "ja": "とってもおいしくて、\n目がしゃっきりしました～。", "zh": "真的非常好喝，\n整个人都清醒了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "580b20db8f6e5dd05df7ce886e99226471fa4c57d96b6ef00bb6e878c01d305d", "ja": "よかった。\nそう言ってもらえてうれしいわ、美也ちゃん。", "zh": "太好了。\n真高兴能听到你这么说，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "50d0ea7caa816602bc9692c59322b9aa2afd3bd4af7c30cb877b0391124b4e23", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nよかったら、いかがですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你要不要也来一杯呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6a9ea27b8cfc30e1e4388dcd91db21f88c242230836a6e90938d2b45978f4368", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃあ、いただきますね。", "zh": "谢谢。\n那么，我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "190c158fb0d054dd8e828787d544d6f9372682dbc1e33ee2946b0357f29c0c51", "ja": "……うん！　美也の言う通り、歌織さんのコーヒー、\nすごく美味しいです！　香りも本格的で……。", "zh": "……嗯！就跟美也说的一样，歌织小姐泡的咖啡，\n真的非常好喝！香气也非常浓醇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "31ea4f41c96346e9c0435ee3b8e877b6bdc6dc404939d7007713f8bbd8df5167", "ja": "ありがとうございます。今回、カフェで働く役なので\nバリスタさんにコーヒーの淹れ方を習ってきたんです。", "zh": "谢谢你的赞美。这次因为要饰演在咖啡厅工作的角色，\n所以我去找咖啡师学了泡咖啡的技术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "d35f52ec8b4849c7fa06c768a7b37a050ba88484ca67d29c859f9710253b387c", "ja": "でも、美味しく淹れられているか、自信がなくて。\nみんなに味見してもらっちゃいました。", "zh": "但我自己也不晓得泡得好不好喝，\n所以就请大家来尝尝看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "ef3bfbc1529133e92d587c0e86d99903f9f67f18e4e65e585d9c74f5e74cc007", "ja": "なぁんだ、そういうことだったのね！\n急にお茶にしようなんて言うから、何かと思ったわ。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这么回事！\n你突然说要一起喝茶，我还以为怎么了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "789b386540b8090c06af6f15ba4d3119f16d364fdd1b12d709710db7bcd823d6", "ja": "ふふっ、そうなの。ごめんなさい、内緒にしていて。\nでも先に言うと、気を遣うかと思って……。", "zh": "呵呵，就是这样，对不起瞒着大家。\n但要是先说出来，我担心大家会顾虑我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad68661e379b785f27df9ed69689aa3f3238b0476662aab9556af9ae9eb3a803", "ja": "歌織さん、すごい……\n役作りのために、そこまで努力してるんですね。", "zh": "歌织姊好厉害……\n为了融入角色，居然努力到这个份上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb9be7534ef75e85c86f87b6436ebd87e855e8395353a4c4af1deef4c2c5dac1", "ja": "うん……すごい……。\n杏奈も、歌織さんのこと……見習わなくっちゃ……。", "zh": "嗯……好厉害……\n杏奈也要，好好学学……歌织姊才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "a9252ef7a6f782e5f8eac9c880476a7bdb45682aeeae61358821d475228c5c4d", "ja": "そ、そんな風に言われると、ちょっと照れちゃうけど\n……でも、美味しいコーヒーになってるならよかった！", "zh": "你、你们这样我有点害羞……\n不过，幸好泡出来的咖啡是好喝的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3344a2c3641ae625a1fa399b55be63eced80ea0944a00e070349d119817b675d", "ja": "それにしても、こんなに美味しいコーヒーを淹れられる\nようになるなんて……大変だったんじゃないですか。", "zh": "但话说回来，要学会泡出这么美味的咖啡……\n一定很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "a58d5fb38c36228f01894632b0f5b9973900d9d03e40c2bee044c4c415718856", "ja": "いえ、特に大変だとは感じませんでした。\n新しいことを学ぶのって、楽しいですから。", "zh": "哪里，并没有什么辛苦的地方。\n我觉得学习新的事物非常有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "f458a32dc821f6a988c5a7ce50127fa2e4fffa15fc0bc977a749819ce6554e10", "ja": "……？\n歌織さん……、勉強が好き……なの？", "zh": "……？\n歌织姊……喜欢求知……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "377caca37428c49484a9977645c5300157e5c16e935555c2f73a0f7db0d225b1", "ja": "勉強なんていうほどのことじゃないのよ、杏奈ちゃん。\nこの前、家族とハワイに行ったんだけど……。", "zh": "也没到求知这么夸张啦，杏奈。\n我之前曾经和家人一起去过夏威夷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "f6ed46820a6ac8256770d918ae784f3f84f09426abe704b6f560e64eb3ca1e3c", "ja": "そこで、ハワイの自然や文化、お料理。それに\n銃の撃ち方なんかも習ったけど、どれも楽しかったわ。", "zh": "在那里学到了夏威夷的生态、文化和料理，\n而且也学了怎么开枪，每一项都很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8e6967a223bdd300175e10e0c6bae0ad2c19c476a8460bd429e9cc38dac537b7", "ja": "歌織さん、銃が撃てるんですか！？", "zh": "歌织小姐，你还会射击啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "c273398b68f87c71348a2cffce0b258ba448a7b7133f552d30e49485027c8eee", "ja": "ええ、素人の手習いですけど……。\n父から、一通りの事は習って。", "zh": "嗯，虽然只是个外行……\n但基本流程父亲都有教我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "40cc7fd0909aee817a6f400730039e7e07ff457d9bf8d70e93acf100ee59004a", "ja": "でも、すごい……歌織さん、ゲーム、上手そう……。\nいいな……カッコいい……です♪", "zh": "不过，好厉害……歌织姊，应该很会打电动……\n好羡慕……真的……好帅气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "80fbcb2cff2b6319cab3ab51d2f127b62f31bb2b32500b61a7e3f7cf40d61dab", "ja": "あっ……それより{$P$}。\n今日は、例の映画のミーティングなんですよね？", "zh": "啊……话说{$P$}，\n今天这部电影要开会讨论对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "459da0b8d1d9e64c0ae2131c7d8bfdab48d59937847d482c758bc1639b3b84ea", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。みんな、コーヒーを\n飲みながらでいいから、話を聞いてくれ。", "zh": "哎呀，差点忘了。\n大家边喝咖啡边听我说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "62f4a2a78f2e4b6f8b17dd9a6f05f73404ff0863d38b2e0951a7e8cdcf40a0ce", "ja": "改めて……仮タイトル・『三姉妹カフェ』で、\nみんなが演じる役について説明するぞ。", "zh": "电影名称暂定为《三姊妹咖啡厅》……\n我重新说明一下大家在这部片里要饰演的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b6388d41d01ee2dc17c69bba1d4be688efcfeb9561b7196fd3e67e84d85e1ad3", "ja": "歌織さんは、三姉妹の長女、一夏（いちか）役。\n優しくて控えめな、カフェの店長だそうです。", "zh": "歌织小姐演的是三姊妹中的长女──一夏。\n是待人和善、个性内敛的咖啡厅店长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "bb266abcbce12bb0cdc51879f23c69b6bedf44a5769835c3e2eebc148eb9e6dd", "ja": "『セレブレーション！』以来の演技のお仕事ですね。\n精いっぱい、頑張ります！", "zh": "自《Celebration！》以来就没有接过演戏的工作了，\n我会全心全意加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f3b8d13cf889041c1e56526ef566968a75244284ff5b8c44edab1fd518ec471d", "ja": "静香は三姉妹の次女、二葉（ふたば）役だ。\nシェフ兼ウェイトレスで、オムライスが得意だそうだ。", "zh": "静香演的是三姊妹中的二女──二叶。\n是主厨兼服务生，很擅长做蛋包饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "77f1ed8d98f25c454671327451f54c298ca3ca68959baeeb3e3ed85a831e0b50", "ja": "はい。主演を演じるなんて、アイドルとして\nすごいチャンスです。絶対、ムダにしませんから！", "zh": "好的。对偶像而言，饰演主角可是\n再好不过的机会。我一定会好好把握的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "ae1df75741f928baccafd2f1f8c8a58dc4b3c936e2f3f1866a8c109e2c07684a", "ja": "杏奈は三姉妹の三女、三奈（さな）役。\nパティシエ兼ウェイトレスという設定だ。", "zh": "杏奈是三姊妹中的三女──三奈。\n设定上是甜点师兼服务生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "0217fd8716cd9f13109895e6ffc2dced269e8c8dc49efdd70bb43c2245188b7c", "ja": "杏奈の役……ネコと、しゃべれる役、なんだ……。\n撮影……ちょっと、楽しみかも……♪", "zh": "杏奈的角色……会跟，猫咪，说话啊……\n好像……有点期待，开拍了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "c38bea251da5e91daeafdbd72ba407c91d3ab82e6dabac9b8eff1d44c52618a5", "ja": "美也はカフェに居ついたネコ、ミャオ役だ。\n杏奈の言ったとおり、杏奈とだけは言葉が通じるぞ！", "zh": "美也是把咖啡厅当自己家的猫──喵尾。\n就跟杏奈说的一样，是一只可以跟杏奈对话的猫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "88bbfcf739f94fed004c9dea4265dfec48fcf29d8e1e8da7ecbbb0413cb9c78d", "ja": "はい～。カフェの看板ネコさんですね～。\nがんばって演じますよ～。お～♪", "zh": "好的～是咖啡厅的招牌猫咪对吧～\n我会努力演好牠的～喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "de889074972d9ff2a49f14890f617e687ec0d32b1130e342a6d3cff0839ddd8c", "ja": "そして莉緒は、カフェに訪れたイケメンのお客さん、\n悠利（ゆうり）役だ。", "zh": "至于莉绪，你演的是造访咖啡厅的帅哥客人──\n悠利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_01_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "56a846eec11eed32ecb133dd9c4a0a14b1d5b08b6ea4889c5fa17b4ee747a7b1", "ja": "は～い♪　イケメン役に受かったって聞いた時は、\nちょっと驚いたけど……何事も経験よね！", "zh": "好～♪听到征选拿到帅哥的角色时，\n我还有点惊讶……但凡事都要经验嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
